    "&lt;p&gt;The height of the building would exceed 2.5 metres in the case of a building within 2 metres of the boundary of the curtilage of the dwellinghouse, and the height of the eaves of the building would exceed 2.5 metres. The proposal is therefore not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E.1(e)(ii) &amp;amp; Class E.1(f) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
